    "sections": {
        "description": "Evermag is a clean, minimal &amp; modern WordPress magazine &amp; newspaper theme for news websites, news magazines, online and digital magazines, news portals, local news, school and community newspapers, independent publishers, editorial teams, journalism projects, newsletters, writers and blogs. Lightweight and fast, built for readability: headlines, breaking news, columns and long reads look sharp on every screen. Free starter demos import in a few clicks: local news, tech, sports, business, entertainment, food, fashion, travel, music, politics and more. What makes it different? (1) Fast &amp; lightweight: no page builder, no jQuery, one small vanilla JavaScript file. (2) Self-hosted fonts only, via the WordPress Font Library; no Google Fonts. (3) Editorial layouts: list or grid (2–4 columns), left/right sidebar or full width, with a per-post override. (4) Modern native Gutenberg editor, with editor styles that match the front end. (5) Flexible options in the native WP Customizer: fonts, colors, a header Subscribe button, light or dark footer, and instant search autocomplete. (6) Styled for the free Owldraft Newsletter and Editorial Blocks plugins. Live preview: https://evermag.owldraft.com"
    },
